  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vaccindonationer via Folkh&#xE4;lsomyndigheten 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vaccine donations via the Swedish Public Health Agency 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regeringen har gett Folkh&#xE4;lsomyndigheten i uppdrag att under 2025 besluta att
&#xF6;verl&#xE5;ta eventuellt nationellt &#xF6;verskott av vaccindoser mot covid-19 dvs.
vaccindoser som inte l&#xE4;ngre beh&#xF6;vs f&#xF6;r att s&#xE4;kerst&#xE4;lla det nationella behovet, till ett belopp om h&#xF6;gst 150 000 000 kronor. Vaccin f&#xE5;r doneras till GAVI eller direkt till l&#xE5;g- och medelinkomstl&#xE4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Government has tasked the Swedish Public Health Authority to donate any national surplus of vaccine against covid-19, i.e. vaccine doses that are no longer needed to ensure the national need during 2025. Vaccines can be donated to GAVI or directly to low- and middle income countries.</narrative>
  </description>
